.SS clean\-src
Filter \f[CR]src\f[R] through the \f[CR].gitignore\f[R] it carries
before copying it into the store, so build artifacts
(\f[CR]dist\-newstyle\f[R], \f[CR]result\f[R], \f[CR].git\f[R]) do not
become part of every derivation that names the project source, and a
rebuild does not rehash them.
Only applies when \f[CR]src\f[R] is a path; a derivation is used as\-is.
.PP
