.SS haskell\-nix.options.evalPackages
Packages used to run \f[CR]cabal\f[R] and \f[CR]nix\-tools\f[R].
This will default to \f[CR]pkgs.pkgsBuildBuild\f[R] if it matches the
\f[CR]evalSystem\f[R] (or if \f[CR]evalSystem\f[R] was not specified).
If a different \f[CR]evalSystem\f[R] was requested,
\f[CR]evalPackages\f[R] will default to be: import pkgs.path { system =
config.evalSystem; overlays = pkgs.overlays; };
.PP
\f[I]Type:\f[R] attribute set
.PP
\f[I]Default:\f[R]
.IP
.EX
if pkgs.pkgsBuildBuild.stdenv.system == config.evalSystem
then pkgs.pkgsBuildBuild
else
  import pkgs.path {
    system = config.evalSystem;
    overlays = pkgs.overlays;
  };
.EE
