/modules/haskell.nix
.UE \c
.SS haskell\-nix.options.evalSystem
Specifies the system on which \f[CR]cabal\f[R] and \f[CR]nix\-tools\f[R]
should run.
If not specified the \f[CR]pkgsBuildBuild\f[R] system will be used.
If there are no builders for the \f[CR]pkgsBuildBuild\f[R] system
specifying a system for which there are builders will allow the
evaluation of the haskell project to work.
.PP
