A path is copied into the store, filtered first when
\f[CR]clean\-src\f[R] is enabled; a derivation or a store path is used
as it is, on the grounds that whatever produced it already chose what it
contains.
.PP
\f[I]Type:\f[R] absolute path or package
.PP
\f[I]Example:\f[R]
