.SS src\-cleaned
\f[CR]src\f[R] with build artifacts filtered out, or \f[CR]src\f[R]
itself when \f[CR]clean\-src\f[R] is disabled.
This is what the project is actually built from.
.PP
\f[I]Type:\f[R] absolute path or package \f[I](read only)\f[R]
